  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Could your body's defense system hurt you?",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Your immune system normally helps fight infections,",
      "start": 2.8000000000000003,
      "end": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "but in sepsis,",
      "start": 5.9,
      "end": 7.14
    },
    {
      "text": "that response can damage your own organs.",
      "start": 7.380000000000001,
      "end": 9.94
    },
    {
      "text": "Look at the lining of a tiny",
      "start": 10.1,
      "end": 11.555
    },
    {
      "text": "blood vessel.",
      "start": 11.58,
      "end": 12.399999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Inflammatory signals can make this barrier leaky.",
      "start": 12.559999999999999,
      "end": 15.7
    },
    {
      "text": "Fluid moves into surrounding tissue.",
      "start": 15.860000000000001,
      "end": 17.78
    },
    {
      "text": "At the same time,",
      "start": 17.94,
      "end": 19.0
    },
    {
      "text": "clotting can obstruct small vessels.",
      "start": 19.1,
      "end": 20.94
    },
    {
      "text": "That can disrupt blood flow,",
      "start": 21.1,
      "end": 22.6
    },
    {
      "text": "so organs struggle to get the oxygen",
      "start": 22.76,
      "end": 24.855000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "they need.",
      "start": 24.880000000000003,
      "end": 25.44
    },
    {
      "text": "The infection matters,",
      "start": 25.6,
      "end": 27.160000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "but part of the damage comes from",
      "start": 27.32,
      "end": 29.175000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "the body's response to it.",
      "start": 29.200000000000003,
      "end": 30.7
    },
    {
      "text": "Sepsis is more complicated than an immune",
      "start": 30.859999999999992,
      "end": 33.455
    },
    {
      "text": "system simply being too strong.",
      "start": 33.48,
      "end": 35.53999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Some defenses can also become suppressed.",
      "start": 35.69999999999999,
      "end": 38.139999999999986
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a medical emergency.",
      "start": 38.29999999999998,
      "end": 39.89999999999998
    },
    {
      "text": "Early treatment matters.",
      "start": 40.059999999999974,
      "end": 41.03999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "Protection depends on control,",
      "start": 41.19999999999997,
      "end": 42.61999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "not just force.",
      "start": 42.77999999999996,
      "end": 44.18999999999996
    }
  ],
